  "description": "Garmon played by a child learning — moderate bellows, slight hesitation in the attack, formant a little high and nasal. No drone, no buzz. Just the basic sound of a button accordion producing notes one at a time, carefully. The instrument is alive but the player is still finding their way. The lesson that will become music.",
